{"id":4676,"date":"2023-04-10T11:46:32","date_gmt":"2023-04-10T11:46:32","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/archeryengland.org\/?page_id=4676"},"modified":"2023-04-10T12:17:43","modified_gmt":"2023-04-10T12:17:43","slug":"cace-news","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/archeryengland.org\/cace-news\/","title":{"rendered":"CACE News"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We regret to inform you that the upcoming CACE 2023 has been cancelled. This decision was made due to the challenge of securing a suitable venue and date for the event in a timely manner that would allow us to replicate the success of the 2022 edition.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">However, we remain committed to hosting CACE as a biennial tournament that will provide all participants with a fantastic and prestigious experience. We are pleased to announce that the next event, CACE 2024, is already in the works, and we will inform you of the specific dates and venue as soon as they are finalized.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We appreciate your understanding and patience in this matter and look forward to welcoming you to CACE 2024.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"226\" src=\"https:\/\/archeryengland.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/HMLogos-1024x226.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4689\" srcset=\"https:\/\/archeryengland.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/HMLogos-1024x226.png 1024w, https:\/\/archeryengland.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/HMLogos-300x66.png 300w, https:\/\/archeryengland.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/HMLogos-768x170.png 768w, https:\/\/archeryengland.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/HMLogos-1536x340.png 1536w, https:\/\/archeryengland.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/04\/HMLogos.png 1872w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We regret to inform you t